    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO ORGANIC ELECTRO-OPTIC MATERIAL",
    "describe_ch": "使學生了解下列基本觀念：能階理論；摻雜效應；高分子導電機構；有機發光二極體理論；導電高分子的應用、合成與加工。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is to present an exposition of the basic conceptions of the following topics: What is electrical conductivity? Mechanism of polymer conductivity. Role of doping. Molecular electron-transfer theory. Application of Conductive polymers. Synthesis and processing.",
